Move/Normalize guard at entry then Refresh at exit. All harmless at ~0.005s each — I left them for uniformity rather than trimming, but you can drop the inner one in each pair if you prefer.
One thing I did not add, per your call: no HasWildcards guard in StatPath, since no caller passes wildcards. Just note the invariant is now load-bearing — FindFirstFileW would interpret a stray */? as a pattern where the old GetFileAttributesExW treated it literally. If a future caller ever feeds unresolved input to StatPath, that's the one place it'd bite.

